<title>USA: Asia Pacific Wire &amp; Cable IPO postponed.</title>
<headline>Asia Pacific Wire &amp; Cable IPO postponed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asia Pacific Wire &amp; Cable Corp Ltd's planned initial public offering was postponed due to market conditions, according to lead underwriter BT Securities Corp.</p>
<p>It planned to offer 3.66 million shares in an estimated price range of $14 to $16 under the proposed symbol &quot;AWC.&quot;</p>
</text>
